{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1000_p", "source_sha256": "faf02502522c318f8083fda787f5948fde3e3f53986bdea0d7693f3154a63214", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n海美の新たなパジャマ姿を披露することになっている）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。这次要展示海美全新的睡衣造型。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "9df79c5349c90e646a10a91045b8f7f5aab7cf9a226745a7cdf37eb03afd9850", "ja": "うーん、なんかしっくり来ないな～。他の方法が\nいいのかな？　{$P$}、どう思う？", "zh": "嗯——总觉得有点不太对劲呢～。是不是该换个方法？{$P$}，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8170b9c077350af45e5e63f4746dfbcea3e37c14db558643042492bead1bc10b", "ja": "えっ？　……いきなり聞かれても。\nまず、なにを悩んでるのか教えてくれないか？", "zh": "诶？……突然问我，我也没法回答啊。\n先告诉我你在烦恼什么，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "08d7849ddb987b2440fb96df5fe7fb7333557dbb997ead609561449e37c4b494", "ja": "あっ、そうだよね！　えっとね、このパジャマが\n素敵に見えるように背筋を伸ばして……", "zh": "啊，说得也是！那个嘛，我是为了让这套睡衣看起来更漂亮，所以才挺直腰背……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "3acd5d332090a03906297bb79d62ac557d81e4e4dd1bd6fa64d630bcf2989bbe", "ja": "顎も引いて、姿勢が良く見えるようにしてたんだ。\nでも、なんか足りない気がしてるんだよね。", "zh": "下巴也收起来，让姿势看起来更端正。不过，总觉得好像还缺点什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fcc9166b9b27cdead8ca5f047f3163a820b259ccab046d4e98c39425f0c4d1f4", "ja": "今のままでも十分だとは思うが……。\n海美としては、もう一押し欲しいって感じか。", "zh": "我觉得保持现在这样也已经足够了……不过，对海美来说，还是想再加把劲，是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "77e04f43888d141eaac46ad340ed148b8eafb39179584d68a54211615cc53202", "ja": "あと一押し……うん、そうかも！　このパジャマを\nもっと素敵に見せる方法を見つけたい！", "zh": "还差临门一脚……嗯，或许就是这样！我想找到\n能让这套睡衣显得更有魅力的办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9621c0bf649eb760cc491c78af6f207dbd162a40b4e85e03c9688f47f612903a", "ja": "そうか……。じゃあ俺がもう一押し。『このパジャマの\nオススメポイントを意識してみる』なんてどうだ？", "zh": "这样啊……那我再推你一把。试着“关注一下这套睡衣的推荐亮点”，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "075db02e377e66f9a2301bce5b83434e106a574295dba09bb337fcc312b935fa", "ja": "意識する？\nそれだけでいいの？", "zh": "要在意这个？\n这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c7031068861b879fa7bbf27a08e349610debe67b8d2942237dfacc6fe34d7b31", "ja": "ああ。海美がみんなに見てもらいたいポイントは、\nどんなところだ？", "zh": "嗯。海美想让大家看到的亮点，具体是哪些？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "87f28c5baac5a8804c6b8ed9803ce9df5718fac374fa1127d58b2dc0ec2b4536", "ja": "うーんと……大人っぽいのにカワイイ裾のフリル！\nでも、胸元と腰のリボンもカワイイし……あっ！", "zh": "嗯……既成熟又可爱的裙摆花边！\n不过，胸前和腰间的蝴蝶结也很可爱……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "3d25c11d657f3a512885d918b58b4a1723ac8786a4b473f833b1e0d7030110f8", "ja": "そっか……。パジャマが素敵に見えるのも大事だけど、\nそれだけじゃダメだったんだ。", "zh": "这样啊……让睡衣看起来漂亮固然重要，\n但还不只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "283f8293542a518ae6830c383b8f3f168d9737e2cea548b786fcb372ab109c2a", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！\n私、なんかわかったかも！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我好像明白了什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1080563414d77e45414587a742170942ba526ad86a5ff894faa6ce04ae904574", "ja": "それならよかった。\n海美のオススメポイント、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "那就好。我很期待海美推荐的景点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "57f6f3452cf6a5326e3fb52d0265c25ff0203d91ba1ed592ad8df029fcd7172b", "ja": "うん！　見ててね、{$P$}！\n最高の撮影になるように頑張ってくるね～！", "zh": "嗯！看好了，{$P$}！  \n我会努力拍出最棒的照片哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0463_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c1ce36a5b5726b2262d8c3af53c451fdb5a6555b71594a84af29991e68663c14", "ja": "（パジャマの魅力を最大限に引き出そうとする海美の\n輝きは、スタッフにも大好評！　最高の撮影になった）", "zh": "（为了最大限度展现睡衣的魅力，海美浑身闪耀的表现深受工作人员好评！这次拍摄非常成功。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
